    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">H\u00dcDDAM</h2>It is an open world game that reflects Turkish culture.<br>It has a structure where you can engage in the act of researching and solving events.<br>This game, which is in the horror genre, will lead you to tension, fear and adventure while offering atmospheric environments.<br>You are a religious man, you are helpful.<br>So do you have the courage to solve things?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ENViRONMENT</h2>Fantastic Places Mysterious Exciting Moments,<br>You Will Travel To Different Worlds.<br>You will pass through the dark realms and reach the center of hell.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SUBJECT</h2>Ahmet Hodja, who has mastered the science of Hava\u015f<br>As H\u00fcddam, he clarified numerous cases<br>A girl named Zehra who is sick<br>During the henna night, she gets disturbed and closes herself in her room<br>Her family tells this situation to Ahmet Hoca<br>Hodja comes to the village and stays in the middle of a village abandoned by people<br>what the real hodja witnessed is more frightening than anything.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WARN\u0130NG</h2>The game contains blood and violence in hell scenes.<br>More horror theme is being handled.<br>Sound And Image Can Be Disturbing,<br>May Cause Sudden Visual Panic Attacks.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NOTE:</h2>There is no anti-religious-blasphemy-sexuality-humiliation-and malicious intent in the game<br>The game is developed by one person.",
